{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Reads the inbox: without threadId it lists threads across connected accounts; with threadId it returns that thread's participants and a page of its messages (page 1 is the newest, isDraft marks drafts, To, Cc and Bcc are listed separately; Bcc is present only on outgoing mail and only with whole-account access, and Bcc recipients are not part of To, Cc or participants). Message subjects, bodies and previews arrive between untrusted-content markers. Rows carry id, name, subject, preview, state, lastMessageAt, lastSentMessageFromSelf (true: the workspace sent last with no reply since; false: the other side wrote last; null when nothing has been sent yet) and participants capped at 50. A participant carries records (readable CRM records of any type sharing that identifier, at most 20 per participant) and isLinked (false: no readable CRM record yet); the participants filter supports hasUnset. The result also includes the scoped filterableFields with each field's options and descriptions. Lists omit threads without messages unless they hold a draft.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"filters":{"description":"Array of filter rules, AND-combined. Each rule is { field, operator, value? }. Use only the operators listed in each field's hint; value-less operators take no value. Example: [{\"field\":\"createdAt\",\"operator\":\"inLastDays\",\"value\":30}]. Filterable fields: state (one of: unread, open, closed, spam; operators: in, notIn), provider (one of: google, outlook, mail, linkedin, whatsapp, instagram, telegram, facebook; operators: in, notIn), draft (draft status; value-less operators: hasSome = thread holds an unsent draft, hasNone = it does not), participantContactId (typeId:recordId reference; operators: in, notIn), participants (CRM-link status; value-less operators: allSet = all participants linked, hasUnset = at least one unlinked), connectedAccountId (a connectedAccount uuid; operators: in, notIn), emailFolder (a text value; operators: in, notIn), lastMessageDirection (one of: inbound, outbound; operators: in, notIn), lastMessageSentAt (ISO date string; operators: gt, gte, lt, lte, between, inLastDays, notInLastDays), lastMessageAt (ISO date string; operators: gt, gte, lt, lte, between, inLastDays, notInLastDays). Of the last-message fields, only lastMessageAt counts drafts.","items":{"oneOf":[{"properties":{"field":{"type":"string"},"operator":{"anyOf":[{"const":"equals","title":"equals","type":"string"},{"const":"notEquals","title":"notEquals","type":"string"},{"const":"contains","title":"contains","type":"string"},{"const":"startsWith","title":"startsWith","type":"string"},{"const":"gt","title":"gt","type":"string"},{"const":"gte","title":"gte","type":"string"},{"const":"lt","title":"lt","type":"string"},{"const":"lte","title":"lte","type":"string"}]},"value":{"type":"string"}},"required":["field","operator","value"],"title":"Single value filter","type":"object"},{"properties":{"field":{"type":"string"},"operator":{"anyOf":[{"const":"in","title":"in","type":"string"},{"const":"notIn","title":"notIn","type":"string"},{"const":"between","title":"between","type":"string"},{"const":"hasAnyOf","title":"hasAnyOf","type":"string"},{"const":"hasAllOf","title":"hasAllOf","type":"string"},{"const":"hasNoneOf","title":"hasNoneOf","type":"string"}]},"value":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array"}},"required":["field","operator","value"],"title":"Multi value filter","type":"object"},{"properties":{"field":{"type":"string"},"operator":{"anyOf":[{"const":"isNull","title":"isNull","type":"string"},{"const":"isNotNull","title":"isNotNull","type":"string"},{"const":"hasUnset","title":"hasUnset","type":"string"},{"const":"allSet","title":"allSet","type":"string"}]}},"required":["field","operator"],"title":"Standalone filter","type":"object"},{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"field":{"type":"string"},"operator":{"anyOf":[{"const":"hasNone","title":"hasNone","type":"string"},{"const":"hasSome","title":"hasSome","type":"string"}]}},"required":["field","operator"],"title":"Relationship existence filter","type":"object"},{"properties":{"field":{"type":"string"},"operator":{"anyOf":[{"const":"inLastDays","title":"inLastDays","type":"string"},{"const":"notInLastDays","title":"notInLastDays","type":"string"}]},"value":{"exclusiveMinimum":0,"maximum":9007199254740991,"type":"integer"}},"required":["field","operator","value"],"title":"Relative window filter","type":"object"}]},"maxItems":50,"type":"array"},"page":{"default":1,"description":"1-indexed page number","maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"pageSize":{"default":25,"description":"Results per page, any whole number from 1 to 100, served exactly: page 2 of pageSize 50 holds records 51 to 100. When a result was truncated, ask again with about half the size. Default 25. With threadId set this pages the thread's messages.","maximum":100,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"searchTerm":{"description":"Free-text search against thread name, subject, and participants (list mode only)","maxLength":200,"type":"string"},"sortDescriptor":{"description":"Sort by one field: { field, direction: \"asc\" | \"desc\" }. Sortable fields: lastMessageAt.","properties":{"direction":{"enum":["asc","desc"],"type":"string"},"field":{"type":"string"}},"required":["field","direction"],"type":"object"},"threadId":{"description":"Id of a listed thread (items[].id). When set, returns that thread's detail rather than the list","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$","type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"name":"get_messaging_threads","outputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-s